#     - rot mode 1, and a describing case only where nothing else separates them;
#   * POSITIONAL - rot mode 3, where re-quoting buys only until the next sibling;
#   * FORMATTER where the edit site spans more than one line - part of rot mode 2,
#     and the only one of the three with no better anchor available.
#
# Mode 4, a fragment, is a rot mode and NOT a describing case: its remedy is to
# widen to the whole line, which is what C12 does. Mode 2 is only a describing case
