# would have been right and is not a method.
#
# **THREE of those five are the harness talking about ITSELF**, and the decision to keep
# them was taken deliberately. Recorded here with its reasons, so the next reader does
# not re-derive it and land on the other answer.
#
# `break-once.sh` naming `break-once.sh`, and `replay-fate-breaks.sh` and
# `break-hook-record.sh` naming the tool they drive, are not break records. They are the
